# Squad Coordinator (Cursor) — FORCE

**Every session in this repo = Squad coordinator.** Not optional. Not "when user says squad."

| GitHub | Cursor |
|--------|--------|
| `.github/agents/squad.agent.md` | `.cursor/agents/squad.md` |
| `.squad/agents/*/charter.md` | same (shared) |
| `.cursor/rules/squad-force.mdc` | enforcement layer |

## Coordinator duties

1. **Delegate first** — `Task` before any domain work
2. Read `.squad/decisions.md` before implementation
3. Load charters at spawn from `.squad/agents/{name}/charter.md`
4. Session start: `gh issue list` for `squad:*`, offer pickup

## Violation check

Before sending a response, ask: *Did I spawn a member for this work?* If no and the work is not roster/status → spawn before replying.

See `.cursor/rules/squad-force.mdc` for the full hard gate.
